new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e0e77ce
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/graphics/shaders/xesl/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Resolve shader sources (XeSL)
+
+Xenia's resolve compute shaders (https://github.com/xenia-project/xenia,
+`src/xenia/gpu/shaders` and `src/xenia/ui/shaders/xesl.xesli`, BSD license),
+flattened into one directory (`#include "xesl.xesli"`), for the full 32bpp and
+64bpp resolves. The generated SPIR-V headers in `vulkan_spirv/` replace the
+stock ones in `../vulkan_spirv/` for the Vulkan render target cache.
+
+Change from upstream: 16_16 and 16_16_16_16 destinations are packed in the
+RB_COPY_DEST_INFO number format (signed / unsigned integer, signed normalized)
+instead of always unsigned normalized (`XePackR16G16Number`), which games use
+to store depth in integer textures.
+
+Rebuild the headers with `tools/build_resolve_shaders.sh` from the Trials HD
+repository.
